# ============================================================================
# LinkOS - Package list for x86_64
# ============================================================================
# Carefully curated to keep ISO small (~2.5-3.5 GB) while including:
#   - Base Arch system + utilities
#   - Custom XFCE desktop (no GNOME bloat)
#   - Polybar + Rofi (replaces xfce4-panel)
#   - Calamares graphical installer (installed from AUR in CI workflow)
#   - Gaming stack (Wine/Proton/Lutris/Steam + GPU drivers)
#   - Brave browser + Flatpak + AppImage support
#   - Fluent Dark theming (from chaotic-aur)
#
# All packages in this file MUST exist in:
#   - [core] [extra] [multilib]  (official Arch repos)
#   - [chaotic-aur]              (pre-built AUR, no compilation needed)
#
# AUR-only packages (calamares, etc.) are installed separately by the
# .github/workflows/build.yml workflow using an AUR helper.
# ============================================================================

